```go
	// Allow all requests to reach the group as they might get dropped if router
	// doesn't find a match, making none of the group middleware process.
	// These catch-all routes must not overwrite routes that are already registered
	// for the same path and method (e.g. by another group sharing the same prefix).
	for _, path := range []string{"", "/*"} {
		for _, m := range methods {
			if _, ok := g.echo.router.routes[m+g.prefix+path]; ok {
				continue
			}
			g.Add(m, path, NotFoundHandler)
		}
	}
```

(`methods` is the package-level slice of HTTP methods already used by `Group.Any`; `g.echo.router.routes` is the `map[string]*Route` keyed by `method+path` that `Echo.add` fills.)

